    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game plunges players into a world filled with fantasy and challenges, where they play as a brave Demon Dragon. Using the ASDW keys to move, the space bar to jump, and the left mouse button to attack, players navigate through a series of intricately designed levels. The objective is to progress by skillfully utilizing various abilities to defeat enemies blocking the way. Uniquely, the game features cannon mechanisms; players can control the Demon Dragon to run into a cannon and launch at the optimal angle, allowing for direct travel to distant locations, significantly enhancing the game's fun and strategic elements. Obstacles in the game are not limited to the front; players must also be wary of traps above and below, avoiding missteps that could lead to failure. With vibrant visuals and rich details, coupled with tense and exciting background music, the game creates a mysterious and adventurous atmosphere for players to explore.</p>",
